# analyze_page prompt template (Jinja2)
# Provide clear instructions to the LLM for extracting page structure, forms, navigation, interactive elements, and business-critical flows.

{% raw %}
Task: Analyze the web page at {{ url }} and return a structured JSON describing:
 - Page metadata (title, meta description)
 - Main navigation and key links
 - Forms (id, action, fields with types and labels)
 - Buttons and interactive elements
 - Typical user flows (login, search, checkout — if present)
 - Any dynamic content that likely requires JS rendering

Return only JSON conforme to the agreed schema.
{% endraw %}
